        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write about a journey by road: the route, the traffic and anything that happened.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Explain aloud to the police or to your insurance company how a small accident happened."
